### 1. Crear Cliente
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Empresa Demo SAS",
  "email": "demo@empresa.com",
  "phone": "3001234567",
  "company": "Demo SAS"
}

### 2. Crear Producto
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Servicio de Consultoría",
  "description": "Consultoría tecnológica para Pymes",
  "price": 850000,
  "stock": 50,
  "category": "Servicios"
}

### 3. Listar Clientes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/clients

### 4. Listar Productos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products

### 5. Actualizar Cliente
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/clients/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Empresa Demo Actualizada",
  "email": "demo@empresa.com",
  "phone": "3009998877",
  "company": "Demo SAS Actualizada",
  "isActive": true
}

### 6. Eliminar Cliente
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/clients/1

### 7. Prueba de error (ID no existe)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/clients/999